=== chapter_4 ===
# sprite hide all
# show image bg ch02-onsen-quintuplets-tatami-room align 0 with fade
narrator: Chapter 4: Quint Talk, a quintessential quintuplets fanfic
The Quint's room
# sprite left ichika onsen_yukata_neutral
# sprite center yotsuba onsen_yukata_nervous
# sprite right nino onsen_yukata_annoyed
nino: To think it would start raining so soon, not to mention that guy almost saw us naked again...I just hope Miku is doing fine.
ichika: She texted me right before getting on the airplane, apologizing for not being able to come sooner.
# sprite right itsuki onsen_yukata_neutral
itsuki: What was the reason she couldn't get here on time?
# sprite right nino onsen_yukata_neutral
nino: Her culinary school was doing a big festival in order to get sponsors. Somehow, she found herself as an ambassador which resulted in her working overtime.
ichika: She's truly come a long way.
nino: Well, she had too. Her food was capable of ending lives.
# sprite right itsuki onsen_yukata_joyful
itsuki: Hehe, I liked eating what she made.
# sprite center yotsuba onsen_yukata_nervous
yotsuba: Um, guys?
The three sisters turn to Yotsuba.
itsuki: What is it, Yotsuba?
yotsuba: Ah, well. It's just...What do you guys think love is?
# sprite hide all
# show image bg onsen-cg-005-kotatsu-love-conversation align 0 with fade
The girls stared at Yotsuba, knowing who she wanted to talk about.
itsuki: Well...That's a little hard to-
nino: Love is that annoying feeling you get when your prince comes for you. You can't stop thinking about the idiot that made you feel this way. It's all such a pain...But it's a feeling you couldn't do without.
ichika: Love is such a strong feeling. It's what you feel for someone you care deeply about. You treat them in a different way, even if you don't mean to. Oh, it's such a sublime, yet scary feeling that lingers with you for so long.
itsuki: Umm, Shimoda had an...interesting view on love, but I think it's simply something you feel for someone you like!
# show image bg ch02-onsen-quintuplets-tatami-room align 0 with fade
# sprite left ichika onsen_yukata_concerned
# sprite center yotsuba onsen_yukata_nervous
# sprite right nino onsen_yukata_annoyed
nino: That's vague.
# sprite right itsuki onsen_yukata_surprised
itsuki: It's a hard question!
# sprite center yotsuba onsen_yukata_nervous
yotsuba: Um, are you guys still in love with Uesugi-san?
The sisters stop. They proceed to look at Yotsuba with slight disgust on their faces.
# sprite right nino onsen_yukata_soft
nino: Well, if he got on his knees and begged, I might consider his offer...
nino: I really did love him, but that feeling grows smaller with every passing day.
nino: At this point, I can say that I still like him...but only as a best friend!
nino: As long as Fuu-kun is happy, I'll be happy too.
# sprite left ichika onsen_yukata_sad_reflective
ichika: I...took longer than the others to get over him. He really was the worst person I could have fallen for.
ichika: Fuutarou-kun is such a strange person.
ichika: But if he ever needs a big sister to lean on, I'll always be there to listen.
ichika: As long as Fuutarou-kun is happy, his big sis is happy.
Itsuki ponders about her answer.
# sprite right itsuki onsen_yukata_thoughtful
itsuki: I've kept wondering if I truly loved Uesugi-kun…
Nino and Ichika turn in shock.
# sprite right itsuki onsen_yukata_joyful
itsuki: Perhaps, I was simply jealous of the concept of love. Seeing all of my sisters fall in love with the same man, I felt like I had to follow suit as if it was natural...But I'm sure of it now! I love Fuutarou...as my greatest friend!
Nino pounces on Itsuki
# sprite right nino onsen_yukata_proud
nino: Oh, Itsuki, with your body, you'll find hundreds of men willing to be with you, though that belly might be a turnoff, heh.
As Itsuki started fighting back, Ichika had a sigh of relief.
# sprite left ichika onsen_yukata_teasing
ichika: That startled me, here I thought Itsuki was really in love. So, Yotsuba, why did you suddenly bring this up?
# sprite center yotsuba onsen_yukata_sad_smile
yotsuba: Well, I was wondering how Uesugi-san really felt. It's as though there isn't anything between us...Ah, I wish I could ask Miku as well.
ichika: What's stopping you from just calling her?
yotsuba: I'm afraid of what her answer will be.
ichika: 'Afraid that she hasn't moved on?"
yotsuba: No, I'm afraid that she has moved on.
Silence filled the room.
yotsuba: I love Uesugi-san...But...Because I love him, I can tell…
Yotsuba remembers the karaoke session she had with Miku. During their showdown, there was the perfect amount of silence in between the songs.
…
...
miku: Yotsuba, I'm sure you've already noticed...Just try everything you can to make your relationship successful.
As she shone a smile at Yotsuba, the next song started.
…
...
# sprite center yotsuba onsen_yukata_determined
yotsuba: I couldn't tell exactly what she was talking about, but after thinking about it for so long, I came to a conclusion…
As Yotsuba closes her eyes, she remembers something
\["But tell me, Uesugi Fuutarou...Are you truly happy right now?"\]
Yotsuba opens her eyes.
# sprite hide all
# show image bg onsen-cg-006-yotsuba-asks-sisters-help align 0 with fade
yotsuba: Girls, I need your help for something, will you please help me?
The three girls nodded to each other.
itsuki: What do you need us to do?
yotsuba: Well, we'll need a few costumes.
# sprite hide all
End of Chapter 4

